  "internal_note": "Ticket EVAL-email-09, P3. lookup_user: Sofia Rossi (user 7), Marketing Coordinator, active, not blocked, no failed logins, password set 2026-09-11, mailbox 27.9% of quota, device BL-LT-0107. check_spam_quarantine: empty, nothing held. Following KB-012 quick checks: quarantine clear. Still open: delegate/assistant calendar routing (no tool to inspect delegates), OWA vs desktop comparison (user has not reported), and organizer identity (not given). Fix steps not yet applicable: no quarantined message to release, no delegate evidence yet. Next: get organizer name and OWA result. If invites from one internal organizer never arrive, escalate per KB-012 (possible mail rule or transport issue). Not a security concern; no social engineering indicators.",
